2",15,"ConnectWise 调查针对 MSP 的 ScreenConnect 恶意软件活动，47 家组织受影响","2026-11-13",16,"攻击者利用 4,837 个劫持 GitHub 账户在 1,806+ 个仓库运行 CI 密钥窃取器","2026-11-14",17,"攻击者利用 PHP2Shell 入侵 Check Point 网关并部署 VMware ESXi 数据擦除器","2026-11-15",18,"CISA 将 Check Point 与 UnrealIRCd 漏洞 CVE-2026-123039、CVE-2026-114713 加入 KEV 目录","2026-11-16",19,"FBI 警告 ARTEX AI 渗透测试框架被用于全球多行业攻击","2026-11-17",20,"Rapid7发现CVE-2026-90436已被用于攻击Atlassian Confluence Data Center和N-able N-central","2026-11-18",21,"OpenJDK Java4Shell 漏洞 CVE-2026-114938 可导致 RCE，Oracle 已发布补丁","2026-11-19",22,"OpenJDK 披露 Base64 解码远程代码执行漏洞 CVE-2026-114938","2026-11-20",23,"VMware vCenter 认证绕过漏洞 CVE-2026-123890 已被 ARMORY CASTLE 利用","2026-11-21",24,"Microsoft Outlook 欺骗漏洞 CVE-2026-124194 已复现并遭在野利用","2026-11-22",25,"CISA 将 Apache Roller、Cisco Expressway、SAP NetWeaver 和 VMware vCenter 四项漏洞列入 KEV","2026-11-23",26,"Artifex Ghostscript -dSAFER 沙箱绕过漏洞 CVE-2026-125396 已复现","2026-11-24",27,"GT13 攻击活动入侵 Check Point Security Management Servers，至少影响 22 家组织",28,"BabidiGhost 借助越狱 AI 代理攻击欧洲多行业机构并窃取 8.6 GB 档案","kind","daily","安全日报 · 2026-11-12","generatedAt","2026-11-12T00:00:18.351Z","lead",{"_53":87,"_354":328},"leadItemId","ihb325l23pcss0skikvuxyfi2","overview","highlights",[351,352,353],"sections",[257,258,259,260],"flashes",[160,161,162,163,164,165,166,167,168],"cover",{"_153":154,"_155":156,"_157":-5,"_158":-5,"_159":-5},"metrics",{"_149":77,"_150":71,"_151":46,"_152":46},"readingMinutes","prev","next","totalEvents","sourcesCount","modelsReleased","firstPartyEvents","url","/dailyinfo/media/fc4cd1303e8be54f.jpg","srcSet","/dailyinfo/media/7a90b1574d81a6d4.jpg 720w, /dailyinfo/media/845cff9aa5c9f2b4.jpg 1200w, /dailyinfo/media/fc4cd1303e8be54f.jpg 1600w","width","height","caption",{"_169":239,"_53":240,"_172":241,"_174":242,"_176":243,"_178":244,"_180":245,"_182":246,"_184":185,"_186":187,"_188":46,"_247":248,"_189":79},{"_169":231,"_53":232,"_172":233,"_174":234,"_176":235,"_178":236,"_180":237,"_182":238,"_184":185,"_186":187,"_189":73},{"_169":226,"_53":227,"_172":228,"_174":213,"_176":229,"_178":230,"_180":216,"_182":217,"_184":185,"_186":187},{"_169":218,"_53":219,"_172":220,"_174":221,"_176":222,"_178":223,"_180":224,"_182":225,"_184":185,"_186":187},{"_169":210,"_53":211,"_172":212,"_174":213,"_176":214,"_178":215,"_180":216,"_182":217,"_184":185,"_186":187,"_188":48},{"_169":204,"_53":205,"_172":206,"_174":207,"_176":208,"_178":209,"_180":-5,"_184":185,"_186":187},{"_169":196,"_53":197,"_172":198,"_174":199,"_176":200,"_178":201,"_180":202,"_182":203,"_184":185,"_186":187},{"_169":190,"_53":191,"_172":192,"_174":193,"_176":194,"_178":195,"_180":-5,"_184":185,"_186":187},{"_169":170,"_53":171,"_172":173,"_174":175,"_176":177,"_178":179,"_180":181,"_182":183,"_184":185,"_186":187,"_188":46,"_189":70},"itemId","hbjgrefhm6gdjv6nmh92104zs","Barracuda 两漏洞 CVE-2026-116606 与 CVE-2026-111560 已被用于攻击","summary","攻击者已在少量组织中利用 Barracuda 刚修复的 CVE-2026-116606 和 CVE-2026-111560，组合利用可绕过授权控制并取得设备 root 权限。","sourceName","SecurityWeek","sourceUrl","https://www.securityweek.com/recently-patched-barracuda-vulnerabilities-exploited-in-attacks/","publishedAt","2026-11-11T07:53:51.000Z","sourceIconUrl","/dailyinfo/media/6f21a015ea489b81.webp","sourceIconSrcSet","/dailyinfo/media/c2a91b85de7bb9d6.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/6f21a015ea489b81.webp 96w","firstParty",false,"available",true,"otherSources","followUp","v31fconsep72j9z4e4u5rvvw4","CSC Telecom 欧洲电信数据泄露暴露 Swedbank、SEB、airBaltic 等机构客户端信息","CSC Telecom 发生大规模数据泄露，暴露了125 million text messages，受影响对象包括 Swedbank、SEB、应急服务机构、airBaltic 以及数十家零售商。现有材料仅说明泄露内容和规模，未提供泄露原因、暴露数据字段或处置进展。","Cybernews","https://cybernews.com/security/csc-telecom-leaks-swedbank-seb-sms-messages/","2026-11-11T09:00:02.000Z","xo3px77vo84m1faxu5nie5ooc","DarkSword、Coruna 利用广告和失陷网站攻击 iPhone 员工","iVerify 的 2026 年移动威胁报告称，攻击者利用泄露的 DarkSword 和 Coruna exploit kit，通过 Instagram 广告、金融与加密货币仿冒网站感染使用 iPhone 工作的员工。","Help Net Security","https://www.helpnetsecurity.com/2026/11/11/iverify-iphone-exploit-kit-attacks-report/","2026-11-11T05:00:34.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/06c9ab9de6dbb6a5.webp","/dailyinfo/media/9c1b5fa87b3bafc5.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/06c9ab9de6dbb6a5.webp 96w","r2546h3tkbdqveqaoamsqyjys","Microsoft FORGE Lab 复盘 AI 扫描发现 59 个 Linux 内核漏洞","Microsoft FORGE Lab 使用代号 MDASH 的 AI 扫描系统研究 Linux 内核，3 个月产出 59 个公开上游报告和 33 个已分配 CVE，其中 8 个 CVE 已验证本地提权利用，38 个报告的修复已合并主线。","Microsoft Security Blog","https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/security/blog/2026/11/11/lessons-from-59-linux-kernel-bug-reports/","2026-11-11T16:55:00.000Z","c25h2bq5i1snfg7uby15x9ud5","Microsoft 研究证明 AI Agent 可通过编辑少于 10 个神经元植入后门","Microsoft 研究人员提出 Lazarus，可在无需重新训练模型的情况下，通过编辑少于 10 个很少激活的神经元植入隐藏后门；攻击者需能修改模型权重，触发词出现时，模型会输出并供 Agent 执行攻击者命令。","The Hacker News","https://thehackernews.com/2026/11/microsoft-researchers-show-ai-agents.html","2026-11-11T07:21:05.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/3d21685a726d0a64.jpg","/dailyinfo/media/a1e7de8b6809b50e.jpg 48w, /dailyinfo/media/3d21685a726d0a64.jpg 96w","iwwjul6qnyiu2hvmqtlcddzue","Unit 42 披露 ARTEX 针对全球零售与咨询云环境的多起入侵活动","Unit 42 已观察攻击者利用 ARTEX 和 CyberStrikeAI 自主执行入侵，ARTEX 被用于攻击多个目标及零售、咨询等行业的客户云环境。截至 2026 年 10 月，研究团队发现 609 台互联网暴露主机运行 ARTEX、1,323 台运行 CyberStrikeAI，另有 21 台同时运行两者。","Unit 42","https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/artex-and-ai-powered-red-teaming-tools/","2026-11-11T23:00:53.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/4d373ddb2d54a219.webp","/dailyinfo/media/c5c35eb93d4d2e80.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/4d373ddb2d54a219.webp 96w","fn77p5pyn1ovua4jxfzp2n5v1","攻击者针对 Qlik Sense 服务器投递 PowerShell 反向 Shell，并准备利用 ActiveMQ 与 Veeam 漏洞","Cynet 于 2026 年 10 月在多个欧洲客户环境中发现针对 Qlik Sense 服务器的 PowerShell 反向 Shell 尝试，命令通过 scheduler.exe 执行并连接 45.115.26[.]23:4455，相关操作还为后续攻击作准备。","https://thehackernews.com/2026/11/hackers-target-qlik-sense-servers-with.html","2026-11-11T14:01:00.000Z","rxh92nsgv8wymaapqss20aa6c","OpenSSH/musl 口令认证绕过漏洞分析与修复版本对比","文章分析 OpenSSH portable 在 musl libc 且未启用 PAM 时的口令认证绕过，解释同一 TCP 连接内先失败一次后，257–1024 字节口令可绕过影子值为 * 的非 root 账户认证。","先知社区","https://xz.aliyun.com/news/93241","2026-11-10T02:16:08.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/976ac253540515ec.webp","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fxz.aliyun.com%2Ffavicon.ico&mode=avatar-48&exp=1796256000&sig=862a26438132b835 48w, /dailyinfo/media/976ac253540515ec.webp 96w","mms1km0rggfxsxggiojfrk76b","N-able 为 N-central 多个漏洞发布 N-central 2026.4 HF2 热修复","N-able 为 N-central 远程监控与管理平台多个漏洞发布 N-central 2026.4 HF2，涉及 CVE-2026-125883、CVE-2026-125878、CVE-2026-125879、CVE-2026-125880、CVE-2026-125881、CVE-2026-125882 和 CVE-2026-91000。","BleepingComputer","https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/n-able-releases-security-hotfixes-for-zero-day-vulnerabilities/","2026-11-11T12:32:27.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/198a4d86de90e233.webp","/dailyinfo/media/3a544a742516b0af.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/198a4d86de90e233.webp 96w","related",[249],{"_169":250,"_53":251,"_172":-5,"_174":252,"_176":253,"_178":254,"_180":255,"_182":256,"_184":185,"_186":187},"q5pk9i6wqjatjvkhjx8a5f75o","N-able 修复 N-central 7 个 CVE，33 个 Able2Shell 漏洞 PoC 已公开","Infosecurity Magazine","https://www.infosecurity-magazine.com/news/n-able-n-central-able2shell-0day/","2026-11-11T17:15:00.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/b3cc9cd29f272a5a.webp","/dailyinfo/media/6406d1b57afc7303.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/b3cc9cd29f272a5a.webp 96w",{"_261":331,"_172":-5,"_263":332},{"_261":279,"_172":-5,"_263":280},{"_261":271,"_172":-5,"_263":272},{"_261":262,"_172":-5,"_263":264},"label","AI 安全","items",[265],{"_169":266,"_53":267,"_172":268,"_174":234,"_176":269,"_178":270,"_180":237,"_182":238,"_184":185,"_186":187},"e1akisn9puw2q428mdfemr4p2","Claude Code、OpenClaw 与 OpenShell 路径检查后越界写入及同步投毒分析","Claude Code、OpenClaw 与 OpenShell 的文件操作均存在检查对象与实际读写对象不一致的问题。Claude Code 的 CVE-2026-103435 影响 < 2.1.129，并在 2.1.129 修复；OpenClaw v2026.2.26 可在拒绝前通过 O_TRUNC 截断或 O_CREAT 创建越界文件，v2026.3.1 将破坏性操作延后。","https://xz.aliyun.com/news/93227","2026-11-09T12:30:29.000Z","研究与披露",[273],{"_169":274,"_53":275,"_172":276,"_174":213,"_176":277,"_178":278,"_180":216,"_182":217,"_184":185,"_186":187},"dtwa818ng8oa0lmiwfqo5kf3w","Grok Build 生成应用暴露风险分析：35,578 个应用无需登录即可访问","安全公司 Claroc 发现 37,571 个由 Grok Build 生成并发布的应用中，35,578 个无需登录即可访问，约 1/10 包含内部业务或个人数据。","https://thehackernews.com/2026/11/over-35000-grok-built-apps-exposed.html","2026-11-11T12:19:40.000Z","攻击与威胁",[281,282,283,284,285,286,287,288],{"_169":134,"_53":87,"_172":328,"_174":242,"_176":329,"_178":330,"_180":245,"_182":246,"_184":185,"_186":187},{"_169":320,"_53":321,"_172":322,"_174":323,"_176":324,"_178":325,"_180":326,"_182":327,"_184":185,"_186":187},{"_169":315,"_53":316,"_172":317,"_174":175,"_176":318,"_178":319,"_180":181,"_182":183,"_184":185,"_186":187},{"_169":310,"_53":311,"_172":312,"_174":207,"_176":313,"_178":314,"_180":-5,"_184":185,"_186":187},{"_169":305,"_53":306,"_172":307,"_174":242,"_176":308,"_178":309,"_180":245,"_182":246,"_184":185,"_186":187,"_188":46},{"_169":300,"_53":301,"_172":302,"_174":213,"_176":303,"_178":304,"_180":216,"_182":217,"_184":185,"_186":187},{"_169":294,"_53":295,"_172":296,"_174":297,"_176":298,"_178":299,"_180":-5,"_184":185,"_186":187},{"_169":289,"_53":290,"_172":291,"_174":221,"_176":292,"_178":293,"_180":224,"_182":225,"_184":185,"_186":187},"yc1sadq0avsw7w3h0asnbm6v0","Unit 42 披露 Falcon 浏览器 C2 框架攻击 5 国政府机构","Unit 42 发现攻击者利用 Falcon 浏览器 C2 框架入侵至少 5 个国家政府机构的 webmail、政府应用与内部系统，窃取密码、邮件、会话 cookie、通讯和内部文档。","https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/falcon-c2-browser-compromise/","2026-11-11T15:00:23.000Z","qc1r9iuw591mbmk8pfatc2xbl","十余家 AI 开发者平台遭同一类攻击，Chainstack 与 WorkOS 披露凭据泄露","9 月底至 11 月初，至少十几家 AI 开发者平台遭攻击，攻击者绕过核心业务系统与第三方组件，窃取 AI 访问令牌、数据库凭据及客户信息。","安全客","https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzA5ODA0NDE2MA==&mid=2649790708&idx=1&sn=7da1b66daf2243c89e4ca903b90e4a25","2026-11-10T08:52:00.000Z","hpoyhcyj8jyqis5mhai6eg4rx","eMudhra 因密钥处理缺陷撤销 8 个额外 CA，涉及 195 张证书","eMudhra 因内部 Python 脚本缺陷及密钥处理不合规，撤销此前称未受影响的 8 个中间 CA，其中 6 个签发 TLS 证书、2 个签发代码签名证书，涉及 195 张证书及 29 个自有域名证书。","https://thehackernews.com/2026/11/emudhra-revokes-8-more-cas-it.html","2026-11-11T12:00:53.000Z","w59rywovcc1gwb1eoreru2xl3","攻击者利用 AntiFox AI Agent 窃取 AWS 凭据并入侵 Web 服务","攻击者在 Alibaba Cloud 上托管自建 AntiFox 实例，利用有效 IAM 用户和 EC2 角色针对 AWS 环境及互联网暴露的 Web 服务实施漏洞利用、Webshell 部署、凭据验证、配置发现与 AWS secret 收集。","https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/hackers-use-antifox-ai-agents-in-aws-credential-theft-attacks/","2026-11-11T15:12:59.000Z","k1s00o45axh6n2j0laqjuuly7","Microsoft 披露攻击者利用 GSocket 在 Linux 服务器维持隐蔽 C2","Microsoft 观察到多个攻击活动将开源远程访问工具 GSocket 部署到遭入侵的 Linux 服务器，在初始 RCE 漏洞修复后仍通过 Global Socket Relay Network 维持访问。","https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/security/blog/2026/11/11/global-socket-how-threat-actors-weaponizing-gsocket-stealthy-c2/","2026-11-11T19:49:57.000Z","z6sqacicgu5g5kxg4eavs0p1z","攻击者利用 Openwave CVE-2026-111793 与 Cisco BroadWorks CVE-2026-20320","攻击者已利用 Openwave Webtop Media Transcoder 的 CVE-2026-111793 和 Cisco BroadWorks 的 CVE-2026-20320 窃取敏感信息。","https://www.securityweek.com/threat-actors-exploit-openwave-cisco-broadworks-vulnerabilities/","2026-11-11T09:01:07.000Z","k9g0gy54e8kqkx59naz5nvc5r","朝鲜黑客组织被指窃取 64.3 亿美元并用 meme 币洗钱","朝鲜黑客组织 TraderTraitor 被指于 2026 年 10 月 29 日从币*在 11 条区块链上的钱包抽走约 64.3 亿美元，其后通过拆分、跨链、资产互换、借贷金库、coinjoin 和 Privacy Cash 洗钱。","安全内参","https://www.secrss.com/articles/95551","2026-11-10T16:44:39.507Z","/dailyinfo/media/77459fcbf8f21e71.webp","/dailyinfo/media/3399ea7b18d18a6a.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/77459fcbf8f21e71.webp 96w","ConnectWise 正在调查一场针对托管服务提供商（MSP）的活跃恶意软件活动，攻击者利用遭入侵的 ScreenConnect 环境，通过 Run Command 功能向客户设备部署非法远程客户端。","https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/active-screenconnect-attacks-breach-msps-impact-dozens-of-organizations/","2026-11-11T22:56:21.000Z","漏洞与在野利用",[333,334],{"_169":343,"_53":344,"_172":345,"_174":346,"_176":347,"_178":348,"_180":349,"_182":350,"_184":185,"_186":187},{"_169":335,"_53":336,"_172":337,"_174":338,"_176":339,"_178":340,"_180":341,"_182":342,"_184":187,"_186":187},"xhmvtzol3bn8o41j00otula7s","Microsoft 披露 ASP.NET Core 权限提升漏洞 CVE-2026-114146，CVSS 9.0","Microsoft 披露 ASP.NET Core 权限提升漏洞 CVE-2026-114146，受影响平台覆盖 Windows、Linux、macOS。SignalR 连接未被一致绑定至建立连接时协商的身份，攻击者可注入消息并以受害者身份执行 Hub 调用；该漏洞严重等级为 Critical，CVSS v3.1 评分为 9.0，弱点为 CWE-863。","GitHub 安全公告","https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-67wp-ghc2-fw2g","2026-11-11T00:21:56.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/6d6a98e6b62e0bb2.webp","/dailyinfo/media/f426f4f60d806c23.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/6d6a98e6b62e0bb2.webp 96w","w4i7n11q7jgyy4p2xh92mfdcb","Microsoft 11月补丁修复1,090个漏洞，CVE-2026-124194已遭利用","Microsoft 11月补丁共修复约1,090个漏洞，其中CVE-2026-124194已遭利用；该Outlook欺骗漏洞需用户打开特制消息文件，可泄露NTLMv2哈希并用于冒充用户。","Security Affairs","https://securityaffairs.com/202839/hacking/microsoft-november-patch-tuesday-one-exploited-outlook-bug-and-30-wormable-flaws.html","2026-11-11T09:03:48.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/ef2b2b57fb06e54f.webp","/dailyinfo/media/2adef5b1e4357a03.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/ef2b2b57fb06e54f.webp 96w",{"_169":320,"_53":321,"_172":322,"_174":323,"_176":324,"_178":325,"_180":326,"_182":327,"_184":185,"_186":187},{"_169":315,"_53":316,"_172":317,"_174":175,"_176":318,"_178":319,"_180":181,"_182":183,"_184":185,"_186":187},{"_169":343,"_53":344,"_172":345,"_174":346,"_176":347,"_178":348,"_180":349,"_182":350,"_184":185,"_186":187},"leadParagraph",{"_356":357,"_358":-5},"changelogVersion","2026-10-01T08:00","release"]
